    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem green_31.variants.upper_eventually :\n    let ans := (answer(sorry) : ℕ → ℝ)\n    (∀ᶠ N in atTop, F N ≤ ans N) ∧\n    ∃ c < (0.98183 : ℝ), ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ᶠ N in atTop, ans N - Real.sqrt (N : ℝ) ≤ c * (N : ℝ) ^ (4⁻¹ : ℝ) + C",
